hpc:USUSP a xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:RSVP a xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:DISPATCH_WINDOW a xsd:string .
hpc:CurrentLoad a owl:Class .
hpc:r15s a xsd:decimal .
